{#
  The practical-info email, a week before arrival (§6.29).

  The one reminder that goes to the renter, and it goes by email because a
  renter has no account and therefore no notification centre — that is the
  distinction §6.29 is emphatic about.

  Deliberately carries no tracking link: this email is a reminder, not a new
  authorisation, and the renter already has their link from the
  acknowledgement. Re-sending it here would put a capability into an email
  nobody asked for.
#}
<p>Bonjour {{ booking.renterName }},</p>

<p>
    Votre séjour à <strong>{{ asset.name }}</strong> approche : arrivée le
    {{ booking.arrivalDate|date_fr }}, départ le {{ booking.departureDate|date_fr }}.
</p>

{% if asset.arrivalTime or asset.departureTime %}
    <p>
        {% if asset.arrivalTime %}Arrivée à partir de {{ asset.arrivalTime }}.{% endif %}
        {% if asset.departureTime %}Départ pour {{ asset.departureTime }} au plus tard.{% endif %}
    </p>
{% endif %}

{% if contacts is not empty %}
    <p>Vos contacts sur place :</p>
    <ul>
        {% for contact in contacts %}
            <li>{{ contact.display_name }}{% if contact.phone %} — {{ contact.phone }}{% endif %}</li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
{% endif %}

{% if asset.emergencyPhone %}
    <p>
        En cas d'urgence pendant votre séjour : <strong>{{ asset.emergencyPhone }}</strong>.
    </p>
{% endif %}

<p>Bon séjour,<br>{{ site_name }}</p>
